                "description": "The satisfies map, the count of skills with and without a Tool, then the verdict. Exit 0 every join holds, 1 at least one does not. A skill with NO Tool is reported and is deliberately NOT a failure — many are pure judgement, and failing on them would make the report unusable.",
                "name": "report",
