          "description": "Find units of a declared prose graph (a library, the skills, the beans, docs) that discuss a query in OTHER words — the vocabulary gap lexical search cannot reach. Each hit is labelled lexical+latent or latent only, and the score is a cosine in the latent space, never merged with a lexical result.",
          "install": {
